Tools

s New file: creates a new file on the Editor;

s Open file: opens a file from your computer;

s Save file: saves a file;

s Download and run: upload the code to your board and execute the code;

s Stop: stop the execution of the code - it’s the same as entering CRTL+C on
the Shell to stop all scripts from running;

s Connect/Disconnect: connect or disconnect to your board via Serial. You
must select the serial port first in Tools › Serial;

s Undo: undo last change in the code Editor;

